{"query":"Three Sixty West (Main Gate)  Worli price carpet area possession RERA","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/oberoi-three-sixty-west","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli Mumbai | ₹12 Cr onwards | Sea View","content":"Carpet Area Avg. Price ₹85,960/sq.ft. The RERA carpet area range for Oberoi Three Sixty West is 5235 - 6651 sqft","score":0.9037116,"raw_content":null,"id":"c26909-00"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/oberoi-three-sixty-west-worli-mumbai-p73494","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price","content":"Possession at Oberoi Three Sixty West will begin in 2024-01-18, and the project is RERA registered under P51900012115 Units. Developed by Oberoi Realty, this","score":0.86303437,"raw_content":null,"id":"f3af34-01"},{"url":"https://sitesetu.app/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/oberoi-three-sixty-west-360","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) — RERA Status & Details","content":"# Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) (RERA P51900012115): price, possession and the verified record\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West (360) is a 1.58-acre, 284-unit  project by Oberoi Realty at Worli, South Mumbai, registered with MahaRERA as P51900012115 and listed at Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+. Possession is the one thing the record does not agree on: the promoter’s own filing declares 31 Dec 2021, the authority’s current record shows 30 Jun 2022, and marketing says Jun 2022.\n\n## Is Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) RERA approved?\n\nYes. It is registered with MahaRERA under P51900012115, covering 1.58 acres with 284 residential units and 6 recorded approvals.\n\nSource: MahaRERA registration certificate P51900012115.\n\n## When is possession at Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)? [...] | Project | Promoter | Price | Possession |\n ---  --- |\n| Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) | Oberoi Realty | Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+ | 30 Jun 2022 |\n| Oberoi Elysian | Oberoi Realty | Starting ~Rs 5.6 Cr (3 BHK) to Rs 16+ Cr (large 4 BHK) | 2027-06-30 |\n| Lodha Sea Face | Lodha Developers Limited (formerly Macrotech Developers Limited) | 58.91 Cr - 98.61 Cr (some transactions up to Rs 187 Cr) | 2029-02-28 |\n| Oceanic | Oberoi Realty Limited | On request | 2030-12-31 |\n| OMKAR CHS LTD | LAKSHMI BUILDERS AND DEVELOPERS | On request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales office | 2024-06-30 |\n| Nahar Cayenne | NAHAR BUILDERS LTD | On request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales office | 2018-02-28 |\n\n### Get the verified dossier [...] ## When is possession at Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nThere are 3 different dates on record. The promoter committed to 31 Dec 2021 in its own RERA filing. The authority’s current public record shows 30 Jun 2022. Marketing says Jun 2022.\n\n!None of these is an occupancy certificate. A declared completion date is what the promoter filed, not proof of delivery.\n\nSource: the promoter's RERA filing (Form REP-I) and the authority's registered-project index.\n\n## What is the price of Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nPublicly listed at Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+. No dated, unit-specific price list was sourced against this registration, so treat the band as indicative rather than an offer.\n\n### Amenities on record","score":0.8467682,"raw_content":null,"id":"ed67ab-02"},{"url":"https://realtypromoo.com/projects/oberoi-realty-worli-mumbai-project","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West, Worli Mumbai — Price | RealtyPromoo","content":"A: Yes.\nThree Sixty West is registered under MahaRERA registration number P51900012115\n, verifiable on the MahaRERA portal.\n\nQ: What is the possession date for Three Sixty West Worli?\n\nA: The project is ready-to-move.\nPossession began from 18 January 2024\n, and homes are being handed over on a rolling basis.\n\nQ: What is the price range at Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nA:\n4 BHK apartments are priced from ₹45 Cr onwards while 5 BHK apartments are available from ₹57.17 Cr onwards\n, with premium-floor and view-facing units crossing ₹99 Cr in resale.\n\nQ: Is Oberoi Realty a reliable builder? [...] Three Sixty West is complete and ready to move.\nThe project is RERA registered under P51900012115 and possession began from 18 January 2024.\nBoth towers — the 52-floor Ritz-Carlton hotel tower and the 66-floor residential tower — are structurally complete with the podium operational.\nThe project has demonstrated strong buyer activity; as of February 2026, 15 residential transactions had been registered amounting to approximately ₹1,702 Cr. Earlier updates show that by November 2025, around 71 out of 284 launched units had already been booked across multiple apartment categories. [...] ## Amenities\n\nThree Sixty West offers the best-in-class residential experience through Club 360. Two distinct zones, spread across two levels, have areas for sports, fitness, kids' activities and adventure at one end and leisure, lounging and relaxation at the other.\nThe Ritz-Carlton, Mumbai has 220 rooms, fine dining restaurants, a sea view bar, a spa and expansive banquet and other exclusive facilities all of which can be availed by residents for themselves or their guests.\n\n## Price & Configuration\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq.ft.) | Price (₹) | Approx. Price/Sq.ft. |\n ---  --- |\n| 4 BHK | 5,235 | ₹45 Cr – ₹78.5 Cr onwards | ₹86,000 – ₹1,50,000 |\n| 5 BHK | 6,651 | ₹57.17 Cr – ₹99 Cr onwards | ₹86,000 – ₹1,49,000 |","score":0.83710164,"raw_content":null,"id":"5cbecc-03"},{"url":"https://divyahousingagency.com/property/three-sixty-west","title":"Three Sixty West 4 BHK in Versova, Worli - Divya Housing Agency","content":"The listed price is ₹46 Cr++. Prices are indicative and exclude stamp duty, registration. This listing is shown as a 4 BHK with carpet area of 5400 SqFt.","score":0.8335554,"raw_content":null,"id":"f85250-04"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-three-sixty-west/64854/project","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan ...","content":"priced from ₹ 45.00 Cr to ₹ 57.17 Cr. Configuration Carpet Area Price 4 BHK Apartment 5235 Sq. Ft. ₹ 45.00 Cr 5 BHK Apartment 6651 Sq. Ft. ₹ 57.17 Cr","score":0.8127637,"raw_content":null,"id":"d7b7ca-05"}],"response_time":3.66,"request_id":"520ea018-8095-4349-b2b2-f5dd74f2a64f"}